# Security and OSINT ethics

- Use and recommend this tool only for lawful, defensive OSINT and research.
  Respect site terms and local law. Do not assist harassment or unauthorized access.
- Custom `-catalog` paths are a trust boundary: never suggest loading untrusted JSON.
- Do not weaken catalog URL/host/header validation in `internal/catalog`.
- Do not re-enable environment `HTTP_PROXY` / `HTTPS_PROXY` / `ALL_PROXY` in
  direct mode; proxied egress requires explicit `-proxy` or `-tor`.
- Prefer scoped live probes (`-site`, small catalogs) over `-profile full` or
  unbounded `-validate-catalog` when the agent runs network commands.
